{"id":"3320259157","kind":"answer","title":"艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线怎么使用？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2023-12-10","updated":"2023-12-10","votes":103,"comment_count":15,"minutes":2,"chars":724,"keywords":["间隔重复","测试效应","FSRS","可提取性","RMSE"],"summary":"看到高赞几个回答还在用什么复习计划表来碰瓷艾宾浩斯，我只能说放下助人情结，尊重他人命运。 但是我的职业病又犯了，有关记忆周期的谣言，我实在是忍不了。 复习周期和艾宾浩斯没有半毛钱关系！！！ 复习周期和艾宾浩斯没有半毛钱关系！！！ 复习周期和艾宾浩斯没有半毛钱关系！！！ 重要的事情说三遍。艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线的用途，实际上是描述艾宾…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/380344340/answer/3320259157","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"ygPStFsH\">看到高赞几个回答还在用什么复习计划表来碰瓷艾宾浩斯，我只能说放下助人情结，尊重他人命运。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-f7cf4f6bd24995e9e1a5dd92bcfaa84b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0774864fcb5a01b53439e4b613b1af75\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-0774864fcb5a01b53439e4b613b1af75_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"767\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-f7cf4f6bd24995e9e1a5dd92bcfaa84b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0774864fcb5a01b53439e4b613b1af75\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0774864fcb5a01b53439e4b613b1af75_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"767\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"Rlc1WqrO\">但是我的职业病又犯了，有关记忆周期的谣言，我实在是忍不了。</p><p data-pid=\"T5WNzegW\"><b>复习周期和艾宾浩斯没有半毛钱关系！！！</b></p><p data-pid=\"kHHYhy2k\"><b>复习周期和艾宾浩斯没有半毛钱关系！！！</b></p><p data-pid=\"joLSugqo\"><b>复习周期和艾宾浩斯没有半毛钱关系！！！</b></p><p data-pid=\"khGxMcpW\">重要的事情说三遍。艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线的用途，实际上是描述艾宾浩斯本人在他自己的记忆实验中的遗忘规律：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-805f4c93100bbd8a0e7bacf7b4ffba63_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-238dd46b0f5fc100718388de230373d4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-238dd46b0f5fc100718388de230373d4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"495\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-805f4c93100bbd8a0e7bacf7b4ffba63_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-238dd46b0f5fc100718388de230373d4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-238dd46b0f5fc100718388de230373d4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"495\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"i8q0ij2r\">所谓的 1 天、2 天、6 天、31 天，其实是艾宾浩斯本人做的几组回忆实验中的记忆间隔，分别对应记住 33%、28%、25%、21% 的学习材料。</p><p data-pid=\"USXX4QQR\">用这几个间隔来安排自己的复习，和你按拿破仑的身高来给自己买衣服一样，有点搞笑了。</p><p data-pid=\"H0sYrta8\">那艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线究竟怎么用呢？说实话，没啥用。现在认知心理学已经研究到突触层面的记忆增强了：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ac93bb51e7d6c00438a7bbdcfeca228e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-dda100b4b45839197f9b89a9987fb962\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-dda100b4b45839197f9b89a9987fb962_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1202\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ac93bb51e7d6c00438a7bbdcfeca228e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-dda100b4b45839197f9b89a9987fb962\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-dda100b4b45839197f9b89a9987fb962_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1202\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"M5V8HHci\">但这个也没啥用，理论离指导实践太远了。如果要让我推荐真正有用的记忆研究，那我肯定会建议看看间隔重复的实证研究：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2dbc2730b68fac71f549caab01eca920_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1170\" data-image-width=\"2076\" data-tm-id=\"420309917\" href=\"#/post/420309917\">Thoughts Memo：(2/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之测试效应</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c411e5e812bd614048b34e5a1f48eb9f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1264\" data-image-width=\"2240\" data-tm-id=\"420924493\" href=\"#/post/420924493\">Thoughts Memo：(3/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之间隔效应</a><p data-pid=\"T29flbcB\">但如果你的时间非常宝贵，想要马上就用上基于记忆理论的学习方法，我推荐使用 Anki：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-acfa8f607f2d3c74ba5c660c3ab25df0_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"500\" data-image-width=\"1161\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo：【专栏导航】Anki 教程(电子书)与 B 站 Ankidroid 教程(视频)快速通道</a><p data-pid=\"jHQk53io\">Anki 现在已经拥有了 FSRS 算法的加持，可以精确地预测你的记忆规律，并安排合理的复习间隔：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-82281a99dbafb1ca7b46b067b6fb6c6a_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"907\" data-image-width=\"1537\" data-tm-id=\"671340049\" href=\"#/post/671340049\">Thoughts Memo：FSRS 现已成为世界上最精确的间隔重复算法*</a><hr/><p data-pid=\"sTBKRS7R\">我还在持续努力，打假艾宾浩斯记忆法，感兴趣的读者朋友可以看看往期文章：</p><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/collection/925510885\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">艾宾浩斯记忆法打假合集</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"671340049","title":"FSRS 现已成为世界上最精确的间隔重复算法*","author":"ClarityInMadness","votes":182,"minutes":7,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"420309917","title":"(2/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之测试效应","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":170,"minutes":10,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"420924493","title":"(3/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之间隔效应","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":95,"minutes":32,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"423065882","title":"(4/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——应用指南","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":117,"minutes":29,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"453406457","